{"id":94,"education_philosophy":null,"history":null,"facilities":null,"feature_summary":"主体性と基礎学力を育てる十文字","feature_description":"十文字中学校・高等学校は、生徒の学びたい気持ちを引き出し、主体性・基礎学力・社会性を育てる教育目標を掲げます。中学校では学年に応じて学習習慣と基礎を整え、少人数・習熟度別の授業などで一人ひとりの学びを支えます。中1では学ぶ楽しさを知り、中3では自ら調べたことを発信するなど、段階に応じた学びを通じて協働や問題解決力を養います。","clubs":[{"id":1571,"name":"バスケットボール","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://js.jumonji-u.ac.jp/schoollife/club-committee/","verified_at":"2026-11-15"},{"id":1572,"name":"卓球","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://js.jumonji-u.ac.jp/schoollife/club-committee/","verified_at":"2026-11-15"},{"id":1573,"name":"バレーボール","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://js.jumonji-u.ac.jp/schoollife/club-committee/","verified_at":"2026-11-15"},{"id":1574,"name":"ソフトテニス","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://js.jumonji-u.ac.jp/schoollife/club-committee/","verified_at":"2026-11-15"},{"id":1575,"name":"バドミントン","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://js.jumonji-u.ac.jp/schoollife/club-committee/","verified_at":"2026-11-15"},{"id":1576,"name":"舞踊","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://js.jumonji-u.ac.jp/schoollife/club-committee/","verified_at":"2026-11-15"},{"id":1577,"name":"体操","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://js.jumonji-u.ac.jp/schoollife/club-committee/","verified_at":"2026-11-15"},{"id":1578,"name":"水泳","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://js.jumonji-u.ac.jp/schoollife/club-committee/","verified_at":"2026-11-15"},{"id":1579,"name":"陸上","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://js.jumonji-u.ac.jp/schoollife/club-committee/","verified_at":"2026-11-15"},{"id":1580,"name":"山岳","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://js.jumonji-u.ac.jp/schoollife/club-committee/","verified_at":"2026-11-15"},{"id":1581,"name":"剣道","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://js.jumonji-u.ac.jp/schoollife/club-committee/","verified_at":"2026-11-15"},{"id":1582,"name":"バトン","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://js.jumonji-u.ac.jp/schoollife/club-committee/","verified_at":"2026-11-15"},{"id":1583,"name":"硬式テニス","categor